  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <h1 id=\"title\" class=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2e;\n  --card: #2a2a3c;\n  --accent: #f5c542;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --btn: #3a3a5a;\n  --btn-hover: #4a4a6a;\n  --btn-active: #5a5a7a;\n  --focus: #f5c542;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n.title {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  min-height: 4rem;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 80px;\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--btn-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  background: var(--btn-active);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    min-width: 64px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple, offline pixel-style counter that starts at 0 and supports incrementing, decrementing, and resetting. Negative numbers are supported.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: 0\n- Buttons: Increase (+1), Decrease (-1), Reset (0)\n- Displays only the integer in the `#count` element\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width\n- No dependencies, storage, or network requests\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab to focus and Enter/Space to activate.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup\n- `styles.css` – pixel-art styling\n- `script.js` – counter logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
